# Generate once: node -e "console.log(require('node:crypto').randomBytes(32).toString('hex'))"
# Put the generated value in backend .env, never commit it or change it without re-encrypting accounts.
PAYMENT_CREDENTIALS_KEY=
# Each tenant owner enters Razorpay TEST credentials in Admin > Stores > Payments.
# Only test keys are supported. Enable automatic capture in the Razorpay Test dashboard.
# Local recovery: customers can reopen My Orders > Check or resume test payment,
# then Refresh payment status. This fetches capture status from Razorpay on the server.
# Apply migration 033 with npm run db:migrate before using this release.
# Set true only after test credentials are configured, then run npm run payments:recover
# in a separate process. This only fetches provider data; it never charges or refunds.
PAYMENT_RECOVERY_ENABLED=false
# Safe queue summary: npm run payments:recovery:status
# Check at most one event/attempt: npm run payments:recover:once (requires enabled=true).
# In Admin > Stores > Payments, save a separate Webhook Secret, then reopen to copy its URL.
# Use that URL and the identical secret in the tenant's Razorpay TEST dashboard.
# Subscribe to payment.authorized, payment.captured, payment.failed and order.paid.
# API_PUBLIC_URL must be the public HTTPS backend origin, not the storefront URL.
# localhost cannot receive external webhooks; use an approved public staging endpoint.
# Secrets never return to the browser. Previous webhook secrets remain valid for 25 hours.
# If API keys change, retain the old webhook endpoint for pending orders and configure the new URL.
# Worker retries pending payments every 5 minutes initially, daily after 24 hours.
# Provider errors back off to one hour; REVIEW events require operator investigation.
# Events are acknowledged only after durable storage. Payload bodies and card details are not saved.
# No automatic refunds, pending-order expiry, live payments or COD collection recording.
# Cancel abandoned pending orders from admin to release their delivery-slot reservations.
